@section('content')<h1>Need a new password?</h1><p>Contact your foundation administrator and ask for an account password reset. After checking your identity, they can give you a temporary password that lasts 24 hours.</p><ol><li>Sign in with your account email and the temporary password.</li><li>If you use an authenticator, enter its code or an unused recovery code.</li><li>Choose a new password with at least 12 characters.</li></ol><p>If you have also lost your authenticator and recovery codes, ask the administrator to contact the server operator. A password reset does not remove two-factor authentication.</p><a href="{{ route('login') }}">Back to sign in</a>@endsection